      "receiptSource": "The original source of this receipt isn\u0027t known. Can you help? \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:editor@foodsofengland.co.uk?subject=Foods%20of%20England,%20Puddle%20Pudding\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Eeditor@foodsofengland.co.uk\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E",
      "receiptText": "Hot Chocolate Puddle Pudding\u003Cbr\u003E\nThis pudding separates into a lovely crunchy topped pudding with a chocolate custard underneath.\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nIngredients\u003Cbr\u003E\n4 oz Self raising Flour\u003Cbr\u003E\n8 oz Brown Sugar\u003Cbr\u003E\n3 oz cocoa\u003Cbr\u003E\n1/4 pint milk\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 teaspoon vanilla essence\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 oz melted butter\u003Cbr\u003E\n3/4 pint hot water\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nCombine flour with 4 oz sugar, 2 oz cocoa, milk, essence and butter. Pour into a greased 2 \u00BD pt heat proof dish.\u003Cbr\u003E\nMix together remaining sugar and 1 oz cocoa, sprinkle on top of mixture, then carefully pour water over.\u003Cbr\u003E\nBake at 180C for 50 minutes.\u003Cbr\u003E"
    }
